  lines:
  - speakerName: Boss
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    content: A steady pair of hands. A few things came in at once, and someone has
      to deal with them.
    replyOptions: []
    replyBranches: []
    loopQuestion: 0
  - speakerName: Boss
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    content: "Nothing here is impossible. Just tedious, time-consuming, and important
      enough that I can\u2019t ignore it."
    replyOptions: []
    replyBranches: []
    loopQuestion: 0
  - speakerName: Boss
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    content: Either way, the situation is simple. I can give you a lighter load if
      you want to keep things manageable. Or I can hand over the full list and let
      you deal with everything at once.
    replyOptions: []
    replyBranches: []
    loopQuestion: 0
  - speakerName: Boss
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    content: "So. Decide how much you\u2019re taking."
    replyOptions: []
    replyBranches: []
    loopQuestion: 0
